<title>USA: Kekst partner Andrew R. Baer dead at 51.</title>
<headline>Kekst partner Andrew R. Baer dead at 51.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Andrew R. Baer, a longtime partner with New York public relations firm Kekst and Co, died Monday night of heart failure near his home in Manhattan.</p>
<p>He was 51.</p>
<p>Baer joined Kekst in 1979 after 10 years at Equitable Cos Inc and served as a senior consultant to a number of corporate clients, including Lloyd's of London, Marsh &amp; McLennan Cos Inc, Equitable and Consolidated Freightways Inc.</p>
</text>
